Some quick notes to introduce the features of the user interface:

- The tab strip at the bottom shows active tabs.
  - You can re-arrange tabs, tab color is based on server name.
  - Right click menu for close/force close.
  - alt or esc-# to switch to a tab #
  - /win close: Close a window, -f option to force closure
  * TABS
    - Admin Tab
      - Ctrl-left/right or ctrl-# to switch upper tabs
    - Config Tab
      - Filter at top left to show only desired settings
- HELP
  - Press F1 or use /help
    * Note that this soon will be improved to include help split across multiple topics
- Chats
  - alt-c always focuses the input field
- Rig controls
  - In dropdowns, shortcut keys (A/N/W) / mode first letter exist
- PTT:
  - alt-enter or ctrl-space to toggle PTT (hold in GTK for true PTT)
- VFOs:
  - Double clicking a digit resets it to 0
  - left/right keys navigate digits, wrapping at ends
  - up/down or direct digit entry supported
  - Click desired VFO in userlist for the room (docked only) to switch!
- Zoom:
  - ctrl +/-: Zoom fonts AND window size
  -  alt +/-: Zoom font only do not change window size
  - ctrl/alt 0: Reset to 100% zoom/size
  - F11: Toggle full screen
- Servers:
  - ctrl-tab switches active server for admin/status/host log tabs
- Resource Explorer: ALT-O
- Server choser: ALT-X
- Remote Receiver directory: ALT-Z
